# Unit17
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit17核心词汇

finger/ˈfɪŋɡər/手指/She pointed her finger at the map.
finish/ˈfɪnɪʃ/完成/Have you finished your homework?
fire/ˈfaɪər/火；解雇/The fire destroyed the whole building.
firm/fɜːrm/坚固的；公司/He works for a law firm.
fish/fɪʃ/鱼/We had fish for dinner.
fit/fɪt/适合；健康的/The shoes fit me perfectly.
fix/fɪks/修理；固定/He fixed the broken chair.
flag/flæɡ/旗帜/The national flag was flying high.
flame/fleɪm/火焰/The flames spread quickly through the building.
flash/flæʃ/闪光；闪现/A flash of lightning lit up the sky.
flat/flæt/平坦的；公寓/They live in a flat in the city center.
flee/fliː/逃跑/People fled from the burning building.
flesh/fleʃ/肉；果肉/The flesh of the watermelon is red and sweet.
flight/flaɪt/航班/Flight 101 has been delayed.
float/floʊt/漂浮/A leaf floated on the surface of the water.
flood/flʌd/洪水/Heavy rains caused a terrible flood.
floor/flɔːr/地板；楼层/Her office is on the fifth floor.
flow/floʊ/流动/The river flows into the sea.
flower/ˈflaʊər/花/She received a bunch of flowers.
flu/fluː/流感/He caught the flu and stayed in bed for a week.
fly/flaɪ/飞/We will fly to Shanghai tomorrow.
focus/ˈfoʊkəs/焦点；集中/Please focus on your work.
fold/foʊld/折叠/She folded the clothes neatly.
follow/ˈfɑːloʊ/跟随/Please follow me to the meeting room.
food/fuːd/食物/We need to buy some food for the party.
fool/fuːl/傻子；愚弄/Don't be a fool and waste your money.
foot/fʊt/脚/He hurt his foot while playing football.
force/fɔːrs/力量；强迫/The police used force to control the crowd.
foreign/ˈfɔːrən/外国的/She is learning a foreign language.
forest/ˈfɔːrɪst/森林/The forest is home to many wild animals.
forever/fərˈevər/永远/Nothing lasts forever.
forget/fərˈɡet/忘记/Don't forget to lock the door.
forgive/fərˈɡɪv/原谅/She forgave him for his mistake.
fork/fɔːrk/叉子/He picked up a fork and started eating.
form/fɔːrm/形式；表格/Please fill in the application form.
formal/ˈfɔːrml/正式的/You should wear formal clothes to the interview.
former/ˈfɔːrmər/以前的/He is the former president of the company.
formula/ˈfɔːrmjələ/公式/She memorized the math formula.
fortune/ˈfɔːrtʃən/运气；财富/He made a fortune in the stock market.
forward/ˈfɔːrwərd/向前/Please step forward and introduce yourself.
found/faʊnd/建立；发现/The company was founded in 1990.
foundation/faʊnˈdeɪʃn/基础；基金会/The organization is a charitable foundation.
frame/freɪm/框架/She put the photo in a wooden frame.
free/friː/自由的；免费的/Admission to the museum is free.
freeze/friːz/冻结；冷冻/The lake froze in winter.
frequent/ˈfriːkwənt/频繁的/Frequent exercise keeps you healthy.
fresh/freʃ/新鲜的/We need fresh vegetables for the salad.
friend/frend/朋友/She is my best friend.
frighten/ˈfraɪtn/使害怕/The loud noise frightened the children.
front/frʌnt/前面/Please sit in the front row.
